  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING - pass output.WriteLine to SetupRun instead of an ITestOutputHelper, and use CreateAsync instead of the blocking PersistentEnvironmentContext constructors. BREAKING - renamed: WithTimeOut is WithTimeout, Name(...) is Label(...), Transform takes (from, to, fn), and SetVariable takes a value while SetVariableFrom copies a variable. BREAKING - names are case-sensitive everywhere, public members use overloads instead of optional parameters (rebuild against this version), every exception derives from TimelineFrameworkException, and a run's Stages, Steps and RetryResults are read-only lists. An assertion on a variable that was never set now fails, and so does EnsureRanToCompletion for a step that never ran. New: a fresh environment per run through IRunScopedEnvironmentFactory, RunServices.Owned, VariableStore.SetSecretVariable and StepIOContract.ExclusiveOutput.",
